a5/uploads/origins/26e92c1f-0893-4f2a-bbcb-bbce3675ba0d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f0329c0ca249ea071980119d28516c5d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！背の高いミヤビや他のキツネの描き方がとても好きで（例えばこれ https://x.com/shinonomenashi/status/1956498844331753728 ）、私の友人のキツネの女の子を描いてもらいたいと思っています！彼女はヘテロクロミアを持つ金髪の日焼けした狐の女の子です。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1N-Pp9df3icqZheh0WbQbKB3ER5GARJCq", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@shinonome_Nashi/works/35", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9bc0e07f/uploads/origins/e2eb3e85-c161-4a0e-9cd5-2e5a87db0c1a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5837d17080733e5a705d66ec337ee119", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9bc0e07f/uploads/origins/e2eb3e85-c161-4a0e-9cd5-2e5a87db0c1a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5837d17080733e5a705d66ec337ee119, https://si.imgix.net/9bc0e07f/uploads/origins/e2eb3e85-c161-4a0e-9cd5-2e5a87db0c1a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6742d36a4ea0d910bf459c12f9bd2e3f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9bc0e07f/uploads/origins/e2eb3e85-c161-4a0e-9cd5-2e5a87db0c1a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=95f6875151554819c297b570214960fe 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！ちびみやびの可愛い描き方が大好きです！私の友達のOCと私のOCを同じスタイルでリクエストしたいです。自由に描いてください。よろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1i8vUX4Zbe-q0MgdVwSpvxws5ObL1WI36?usp=sharing\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1OUEPhK2WJ-urei8j2xCywzD1131XlgUk?usp=sharing\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1HD2xl87ux4LC1cOfYMIWT5XXhELzTXI9?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@shinonome_Nashi/works/34", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2da2788a/uploads/origins/c9b7342f-81a0-4c14-92cf-200a8000de48?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e6739ab3567a575450515f154